# Documentation

- Keep README verification status and commands accurate.
- Architecture compromises go in `docs/MVP_IMPLEMENTATION_DECISIONS.md` or a new ADR under `docs/adr/`.
- Agent role docs live in `docs/agents/`; Cursor discoverable wrappers live in `.cursor/agents/`.
- Do not reintroduce a root `rules.md`; project rules are `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` plus `AGENTS.md`.
